description: UI libraries: Toastr, SweetAlert2, Slick, Owl Carousel, imagesLoaded.
alwaysApply: true

- Toastr: centralize init (position, timeout). Use consistent success/error/info patterns.
- SweetAlert2: wrap in helper to enforce consistent titles, text, confirm/cancel labels.
- Slick/Owl: initialize in per-page scripts; avoid duplicate inits; destroy/re-init on Livewire updates as needed.
- imagesLoaded: use to trigger layout/slider init after images are ready.
- Do not load both Slick and Owl on the same element; pick one per use-case.
